OL,3,AUK expected to announce sanctions on
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in occupied West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK is expected to announce
OL,8,Fsanctions on trade from Israeli
OL,9,Fsettlements in the illegally occupied
OL,10,FWest Bank
OL,12,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband is due to
OL,13,Fannounce the move in the House of
OL,14,FCommons this afternoon - he recently
OL,15,Fsaid the UK-Israel relationship would
OL,16,Fbe "reset"
OL,18,FThe settlements are illegal under
OL,19,Finternational law - the UK's move comes
OL,20,Fas Israel opens tenders for 1,200 new
OL,21,Fhomes in the occupied territory
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
